Z||000007||phillip||05-11-2000||12:22 PM||||imma try this one more time. loafer and wkdfiro, you both say you've sent letters to scc with out much result. i may get the same thing. we were each one person making a request. but since this is a nearly 1000 person forum,if only a fraction of the people made the request, say the same number that wiil answer how old they are or will  fall over each other welcoming a new female (and no offence fierogirl) member or argueing over how big an exhaust tip should be, maybe something positive would come out of it.<P>scc, like any other mag is going to cater to a responding and paying audience. i think of the various small car performance mags the best chance for fiero coverage is scc. try to imagine super street doing it ( they'd pretty much have to crawl out of honda's butt to see any thing else). why not try to get one mag thinking about us,even a little.<P>even some of the various venders could contact them. " hey ,if you're considering a fiero article and/or build up we make this to improve it".<P>better to try to light a candle than to sit and curse the darkness.||||reg||1
